"steps":[
["Marinate","Toss the cubed chicken with the seasonings, chipotle paste, lime juice and olive oil and marinate."],
["Sauce","Blend the yogurt, mayo, chipotle paste, pineapple, seasonings, lime juice and evaporated milk until smooth. Bottle and refrigerate."],
["Salsa","Mix the onion, peppers, pineapple, cilantro, honey and lime juice and refrigerate."],
["Bake","Spread the chicken on a large lined sheet pan without overcrowding. Bake at 200°C (400°F) for 20 minutes, then broil 5 minutes until golden and crispy."],
["Serve","Toast a wrap, add hot chicken, cold salsa and sauce, and roll up."]],
